{"actor_ref":"claude","class":"draft_history","document_uuid":"01a1a54a-3086-7179-9bfe-5dba7acbba38","id":"01a1a598-578f-772f-bb66-28cc0b49327f","idempotency_key":"d74bbf8ce33007d6fea3861c495a09b84c57f8b9cecafa7c44a4acbea207d7fc","occurred_at":"2026-11-04T08:06:26Z","payload":{"note":"Progress this session (commits b21a050, and the strip-scoping commit after it): i-3955, i-dd02 and i-5f8c are ticked. The workspace now loads its stored boards from the repository when activated (creating its server workspace on first use), keeps active_board clamped, and the active index rides along in the persisted session so a restart restores it. views/boards.rs renders a strip above the board, on the Analysis tab only, with one chip per board (title, revision, locked) plus New / Copy / Lock. STILL OPEN: i-a52a needs reparent — there is no server route (POST /api/boards/{id}/reparent) and no client call, so only create/copy/lock are wired; and i-9cc5's CDP layout regression was not run (needs ./deploy.sh plus a Chrome session), only the wasm cargo check the ticket names.","target":"t-6c55"},"type":"work.note_added","v":2}
